metadata.description:
{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
BLV scripts for REAPER. All rights reserved, free to use.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
A project launcher for REAPER: find, inspect, organise and open your projects, and start new ones from templates. Requires REAPER 7.74 or newer and ReaImGui. macOS and Windows. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Sorts the selected tracks A to Z by name. Selected folders move as whole blocks and the folder structure is kept. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Puts each selected track's parent folder name in front of its name; "BUS" is left out of the parent name and BUS tracks are skipped. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Puts each track's parent folder name in front of its name, with exceptions for pass-through folders. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Tidies track names to one standard and sorts them. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Renames tracks after their folder and sorts them by the folder hierarchy. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Renames drum tracks to standard names (kick, snare, hats, and so on) and sorts them. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
A small window to expand, collapse or limit folder tracks by how deep they are nested; remembers the last choice per project. Requires: ReaImGui. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Selects every track inside the selected folder tracks. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Copies the numbers of the selected tracks to the clipboard, separated by commas. Requires: SWS. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
A toggle: while it is on, clicking a track's solo button solos only that track. Requires: js_ReaScriptAPI. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Sets every track's volume fader to 0 dB. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Pans the selected tracks 50% left. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Pans the selected tracks 50% right. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Pans the selected tracks 70% left. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Pans the selected tracks 70% right. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Pans the selected tracks hard left. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Pans the selected tracks hard right. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Makes a staggered left and right pair from a lead track's takes, named "1 L" and "2 R" and panned hard left and right. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Extends each selected item's end to the start of the next item across the selected tracks (no time-stretching). Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Cycles the arrange view through set bar lengths, then fits the loop, the selected items, the region or the whole project. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
After asking, ends the project at the edit cursor and sets the render range from the start to the cursor. Requires: SWS. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
Renames every instance of the selected plug-in across the project in one go. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}
